An '''axe''' is a [[melee weapon]] that consists of a pole and one or more "blades" mounted at one or both ends. The sharp edges of the blades are designed to [[Slashing damage|slash]] opponents.

==Types of Axes==
* '''One-Handed axes'''
** [[Handaxe]]
** [[Dwarven waraxe]]
** [[Battleaxe]]
* '''Two-Handed axes'''
** [[Greataxe]]
** [[Double axe]]

==Notes==

* Axes are notable for all having a x3 [[critical multiplier]], compared to swords which generally have an increased [[threat range]] and a x2 multiplier. Axes generally hit critically less often, but do more damage when they do.

==Toolset==
*The [[:Category:Item palette|Item palette]] in the [[toolset]] lists axes in the [[Axe blueprint category]].
